                        <td class="pre_recomm">비중확대</td>
						<td class="rpt_title">철강/비철금속 Blink Report</td>
                        <td class="comment2"></td>
                    </tr>
                    
                    <tr style="mso-height-source:auto;">
                        <td class="brk"><font color="rgb(53,91,157)">메리츠증권</font><br/>김준성,배현서</td>
                        <td class="ind"><font color="rgb(53,91,157)">자동차</font></td>                        
                        
                            <td class="img0">&nbsp;</td>
                            <td class="recomm"></td>
                        
                        <td class="pre_recomm">Overweight</td>
						<td class="rpt_title">Mobility at a glance</td>
                        <td class="comment2"></td>
                    </tr>
                    
                    <tr style="mso-height-source:auto;">
                        <td class="brk"><font color="rgb(53,91,157)">BNK투자증권</font><br/>김지은</td>
                        <td class="ind"><font color="rgb(53,91,157)">화장품</font></td>                        
                        
                            <td class="img0">&nbsp;</td>
                            <td class="recomm"></td>
                        
                        <td class="pre_recomm">비중확대</td>
						<td class="rpt_title">2Q26 화장품 실적 리뷰 & 투자전략</td>
                        <td class="comment2"><span class="comment_text">▶</span> 2026년은 수출 호황이 아니라 성장 구조의 교체<br/><span class="comment_text">▶</span> 혁신이 수요를 만든다 ? 제형·용기, 성분, 스키니피케이션<br/><span class="comment_text">▶</span> 채널은 필터다 ? 소비 양극화와 오프라인 재발주</td>
                    </tr>
                    
                    <tr style="mso-height-source:auto;">
                        <td class="brk"><font color="rgb(53,91,157)">삼성증권</font><br/>정동희</td>
                        <td class="ind"><font color="rgb(53,91,157)">화장품</font></td>                        
                        
                            <td class="img0">&nbsp;</td>
                            <td class="recomm"></td>
                        
                        <td class="pre_recomm">OVERWEIGHT</td>
